          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Who would use this, and what decision does it help them make? </span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">For people that will be taking a job in a different state and trying to find out their income after state taxes. This tool should help them plan and budget as needed together with the financial planning tool created for mp1. </span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Hbol",
      "code_hash": "f7f23c929462a65072f1c8720e02cd0c",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">My plan before AI.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Fetching state tax rates, federal tax rates, social security, and medicare is a must. Then fetching the paycheck. We then apply social security and medicare withholdings, subtract the pretax deductibles from the gross salary, then apply the federal and state tax brackets, , and finally subtract any post-tax deductions to arrive at the net take-home pay.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
